| Run2: runs both tests, keeping a copy of the output in Result.
| (Started by !Run in a task window.)
| The render test reads the fonts shipped in the app (its fonts.conf is
| passed on the command line, so no global variable is set), with a font
| cache in the scrap directory.
CDir <Wimp$ScrapDir>.GTKTest
<GTKTest$Dir>.glibtest { > <GTKTest$Dir>.Result }
<GTKTest$Dir>.rendertest /<GTKTest$Dir> /<GTKTest$Dir>/fonts/fonts.conf { >> <GTKTest$Dir>.Result }
Type <GTKTest$Dir>.Result
